  "project_description": "I have developed a Drupal 8/9/10 module and named it \"Image Crop Widget\" User can crop or rotate an image at the time of uploading an image for a node. It is a very simple module to crop an image. the developer just need to install and choose an imager widget option from the form display page.\n\n How to use \n\n \n After upload image, click on the start editing button \n Click on the Crop icon \n After coping the image click on save button icon \n \n Install with Composer: composer require 'drupal/imagecroper:^9.0'",
